{"id":"277483881","kind":"article","title":"记忆的神经统计模型","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Neurostatistical_Model_of_Memory"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2020-11-07","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":15,"comment_count":3,"minutes":2,"chars":721,"keywords":["记忆模型","记忆稳定性","记忆提取","记忆连贯性","间隔效应","神经可塑性"],"summary":"词条概述记忆的神经统计模型，以稳定性、连贯性、可提取性和复杂性描述长期记忆。它将间隔复习研究得到的统计特征扩展为神经机制假说，涉及神经网络干扰、AMPA 受体、树突棘、睡眠中的突触变化及间隔效应，并试图解释记忆可塑性与稳定性的关系。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/277483881","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"概要"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"由来"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"新概念"},{"id":"sec-4","level":2,"title":"学习"},{"id":"sec-5","level":2,"title":"贡献者"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"wrxRmOK6\">原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Neurostatistical_Model_of_Memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Neurostatistical Model of Memory</a></p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">概要</h2><p data-pid=\"yEW7EcvK\">记忆的神经统计模型描述了长期记忆形成的基本过程。在该模型中，记忆由四个核心属性来描述：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Stability\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">稳定性</a>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Coherence\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">连贯性</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Retrievability\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">可提取性</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>和<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Complexity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">复杂性</a>。</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">由来</h2><p data-pid=\"kimhZLaP\">记忆的神经统计模型是基于从<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Algorithm_SM-17\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">不同间隔复习计划</a>的记忆效果中得出的长期记忆的统计特性。它将<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Two_component_model_of_memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">记忆的双组分模型</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>扩展到分子解释之外，涉及到记忆的长期属性变化的结构和神经方面。该模型提供了大脑作为<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Concept_network\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">概念网络</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>发挥作用所需的基本功能成分。</p><p data-pid=\"sfOKVLoM\"><b>记忆的神经统计模型解决了可塑性-稳定性的难题。</b></p><h2 id=\"sec-3\">新概念<br/></h2><p data-pid=\"NCwFpHCh\">除了<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Two_component_model_of_memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">记忆的双组分模型</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>的骨架思想外，该模型的新贡献是：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"gHcXLkJE\">基于神经网络<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Interference\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">干扰</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Retrievability\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">可提取性</a>统计模型。</li><li data-pid=\"AsGSyl6g\">基于 AMPA 受体的易位、树突棘的生长和睡眠中突触变化的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Stability\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">稳定性</a>模型（见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Two-component_model_of_memory_stability\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">记忆稳定性的双组分模型</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup>）。</li><li data-pid=\"Tlm4AXbN\">基于清除树枝状丝状体的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Spacing_effect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔效应</a>假设模型（见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Structural_and_molecular_mechanisms_of_the_spacing_effect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔效应的结构和分子机制</a>）<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup>。</li><li data-pid=\"a1tPN6aF\">记忆<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Coherence\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">连贯性</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>模型(包括<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Memory_optimization_in_sleep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">睡眠中的记忆巩固</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-9\"><a href=\"#ref-9\">[9]</a></sup>)</li><li data-pid=\"yqdaGc5l\">记忆<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Complexity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">复杂性</a>模型</li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-4\">学习</h2><p data-pid=\"zEeR8g-q\">根据该模型，学习将导致树突棘标记，插入 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/AMPA_receptors_stabilize_the_dendritic_branch\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AMPA 受体</a>，并消除未标记的棘。反向标记可能被用来消除干扰连接。然后，学习将导致树突棘的净损失。此外，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Spacing_effect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔效应</a>可能来自于需要从<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Stabilization\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">稳定化</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-10\"><a href=\"#ref-10\">[10]</a></sup>的部位清除树枝状丝状体。丝状突起的探索性生长将是对突触后活动减少的反应。</p><h2 id=\"sec-5\">贡献者</h2><p data-pid=\"g_SC12TT\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Piotr_Wozniak\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Piotr Wozniak</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-11\"><a href=\"#ref-11\">[11]</a></sup>，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/George_Zonnios\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">George Zonnios</a>（间隔效应），<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Darek_Murakowski\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Darek Murakowski</a>，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Janusz_Murakowski\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Janusz Murakowski</a>（记忆的双组分模型），<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Edward_Gorzelanczyk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Edward Gorzelanczyk</a>（分子记忆）。</p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 一致性与连贯性 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"264327134\" href=\"#/post/264327134\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 记忆可提取性 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"559819340\" href=\"#/post/559819340\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 记忆的两个组成成分 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"179076885\" href=\"#/post/179076885\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 记忆的双组分模型 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"579476637\" href=\"#/post/579476637\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 概念网络 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"266541480\" href=\"#/post/266541480\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 干扰 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"269974053\" href=\"#/post/269974053\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 记忆稳定性的两个组成成分 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"268782211\" href=\"#/post/268782211\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-8\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-8\">↩</a> 间隔效应的结构与分子机理 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"288609114\" href=\"#/post/288609114\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-9\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-9\">↩</a> 睡眠中的记忆优化 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"266856783\" href=\"#/post/266856783\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-10\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-10\">↩</a> 稳定化 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"595158577\" href=\"#/post/595158577\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-11\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-11\">↩</a> 彼得 · 沃兹尼亚克 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"303204832\" href=\"#/post/303204832\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"274352214","title":"遗忘曲线","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":22,"minutes":5,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"279166945","title":"间隔效应","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":21,"minutes":3,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"264327134","title":"一致性与连贯性","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":60,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"269974053","title":"干扰","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":28,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"303204832","title":"彼得 · 沃兹尼亚克","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":70,"minutes":9,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"2020082520478201804","title":"记忆模型的数学形式化","author":"Giacomo Randazzo","votes":17,"minutes":14,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「记忆模型」· Giacomo Randazzo"},{"id":"1907760881749718522","title":"间隔重复记忆系统：已取得长足进步","author":"Domenic Denicola","votes":261,"minutes":12,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「记忆稳定性」· Domenic Denicola"},{"id":"660604968","title":"重试结果可能会提供额外的可提取性信号","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":3,"minutes":2,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Andy Matuschak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"3213802027","title":"中医终于编入中小学教材了，各位怎么看？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":257,"minutes":11,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 257 赞同","evidence":"正文链接锚文本明确指向该译文标题或具体关键词。"},{"id":"3094580151","title":"我国拟制定「爱国主义教育法」，包括利用各类资源、设施及平台等开展爱国主义教育等，哪些信息值得关注？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":58,"minutes":13,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 58 赞同","evidence":"回答使用原生链接锚点“记忆的神经统计模型”明确指向目标译文；该处上下文和目标摘要相符。"},{"id":"2969797619","title":"教育应该带有政治属性吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":48,"minutes":10,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 48 赞同","evidence":"正文以明确术语/文章标题锚点“记忆的神经统计模型”链接到目标译文，目标摘要与该处论述相符。"},{"id":"1582343122","title":"如何可以快速的记忆自己需要记住的内容？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":26,"minutes":7,"reason":"核心节选引用